    "title": "查克·罗宾斯简历",
    "sources": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "url": "https://newsroom.cisco.com/c/r/newsroom/en/us/executives/robbins-chuck.html",
        "title": "Chuck Robbins (Cisco Newsroom executive biography)",
        "published_at": null,
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Chuck Robbins serves as the Chair and Chief Executive Officer of Cisco, which has been connecting the world for the past 40 years.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "url": "https://newsroom.cisco.com/c/r/newsroom/en/us/executives/robbins-chuck.html",
        "title": "Chuck Robbins (Cisco Newsroom executive biography)",
        "published_at": null,
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "He was named CEO in July of 2015, before being elected Chair of the Board on December 11, 2017.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "url": "https://newsroom.cisco.com/c/r/newsroom/en/us/executives/robbins-chuck.html",
        "title": "Chuck Robbins (Cisco Newsroom executive biography)",
        "published_at": null,
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "He holds a bachelor’s degree in mathematics with a concentration in computer science from the University of North Carolina at Chapel Hill, where he was honored as a Distinguished Alumnus in 2022.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "url": "https://newsroom.cisco.com/c/r/newsroom/en/us/executives/robbins-chuck.html",
        "title": "Chuck Robbins (Cisco Newsroom executive biography)",
        "published_at": null,
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Outside of his work at Cisco, Robbins is the current Chair of the Business Roundtable; on the Board of Directors for BlackRock; Chairman Emeritus of the US-Japan Business Council; a Board Member of the US-Saudi Business Council; a Member of the International Business Council for the World Economic Forum; a Member of the American Heart Association’s CEO Roundtable; and a member of the 2019 class of the American Academy of Arts and Sciences.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s5",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/858877/000085887726000132/csco-20260725.htm",
        "title": "Cisco Systems, Inc. Annual Report on Form 10-K for fiscal 2026 (Information about our Executive Officers)",
        "published_at": "2026-09-02",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Mr. Robbins serves as our Chief Executive Officer since July 2015, as a member of the Board of Directors since May 2015, and as Chair of the Board since December 2017. Mr. Robbins joined Cisco in December 1997, from which time until March 2002 he held a number of managerial positions within Cisco’s sales organization.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s6",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/858877/000085887726000132/csco-20260725.htm",
        "title": "Cisco Systems, Inc. Annual Report on Form 10-K for fiscal 2026 (Information about our Executive Officers)",
        "published_at": "2026-09-02",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Mr. Robbins was promoted to Vice President in March 2002, assuming leadership of Cisco’s U.S. channel sales organization. Additionally, in July 2005, Mr. Robbins assumed leadership of Cisco’s Canada channel sales organization.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s7",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/858877/000085887726000132/csco-20260725.htm",
        "title": "Cisco Systems, Inc. Annual Report on Form 10-K for fiscal 2026 (Information about our Executive Officers)",
        "published_at": "2026-09-02",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "In December 2007, Mr. Robbins was promoted to Senior Vice President, U.S. Commercial, and, in August 2009 he was appointed Senior Vice President, U.S. Enterprise, Commercial and Canada. In July 2011, Mr. Robbins was named Senior Vice President, Americas.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s8",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/858877/000085887726000132/csco-20260725.htm",
        "title": "Cisco Systems, Inc. Annual Report on Form 10-K for fiscal 2026 (Information about our Executive Officers)",
        "published_at": "2026-09-02",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "In October 2012, Mr. Robbins was promoted to Senior Vice President, Worldwide Field Operations, in which position he served until assuming the role of Chief Executive Officer. Mr. Robbins is also a member of the board of directors of BlackRock, Inc. (since 2017).",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s9",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/858877/000085887725000150/csco-20251027.htm",
        "title": "Cisco Systems, Inc. 2025 Proxy Statement (DEF 14A)",
        "published_at": "2025-10-28",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Charles H. Robbins BOARD CHAIR Age: 59 Director Since: 2015",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s10",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/858877/000085887726000132/csco-20260725.htm",
        "title": "Cisco Systems, Inc. Annual Report on Form 10-K for fiscal 2026 (Information about our Executive Officers; name, age, and position as of August 31, 2026)",
        "published_at": "2026-09-02",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Charles H. Robbins 60 Chair and Chief Executive Officer",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s11",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/858877/000119312515169227/d920287d8k.htm",
        "title": "Cisco Systems, Inc. Form 8-K (CEO appointment)",
        "published_at": "2015-05-04",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "On May 1, 2015, the Board of Directors (the “Board”) of Cisco Systems, Inc. (“Cisco”) appointed Charles H. Robbins as Chief Executive Officer effective July 26, 2015. Mr. Robbins was also elected to the Board effective May 1, 2015.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s12",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/858877/000119312515169227/d920287d8k.htm",
        "title": "Cisco Systems, Inc. Form 8-K (CEO appointment)",
        "published_at": "2015-05-04",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Mr. Robbins, 49, joined Cisco in December 1997, from which time until March 2002 he held a number of managerial positions within Cisco’s sales organization.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s13",
        "url": "https://www.mercurynews.com/2015/07/30/qa-chuck-robbins-ceo-of-cisco-systems/",
        "title": "Q&A: Chuck Robbins, CEO of Cisco Systems (The Mercury News)",
        "published_at": "2015-07-30",
