        "excerpt": "Birthplace: Grayson, Ga. Age: 49",
        "tier": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "s14",
        "url": "https://www.mercurynews.com/2015/07/30/qa-chuck-robbins-ceo-of-cisco-systems/",
        "title": "Q&A: Chuck Robbins, CEO of Cisco Systems (The Mercury News)",
        "published_at": "2015-07-30",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "A: I have been in the technology industry for 28 years. I started as an applications developer on an IBM mainframe at a financial institution.",
        "tier": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "s15",
        "url": "https://www.mercurynews.com/2015/07/30/qa-chuck-robbins-ceo-of-cisco-systems/",
